{
  "info": {
    "name": "Instituto - Suite automatizada API cadetería (Sprint 3)",
    "description": "5 endpoints x 3 casos (1 OK + 2 con error) = 15 casos.\n\nCómo usarla:\n1. En la pestaña Variables de la colección, cargar baseUrl y los usuarios de prueba.\n2. Correr la colección completa y EN ORDEN (Run collection): la carpeta \"0. Preparación\" guarda los tokens y los ids que usan los casos.\n3. Cada caso valida solo el código HTTP y el \"codigo\" de error que devuelve la API.\n\nFormato de los errores: { status, error, codigo, message, fieldErrors }.\n\nSprint 3: se agregan chequeos globales (tiempo, Content-Type, formato de error), parametrización (idInexistente, maxMs), credenciales en entornos y limpieza final. Ejecución automática con Newman (ver README).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "idInexistente",
      "value": "no-existe-99999"
    },
    {
      "key": "maxMs",
      "value": "1500"
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenAdmin",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenCadete",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenVencido",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "cadeteId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "pedidoId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Preparación (no cuenta como caso)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "P1 - Login admin (guarda tokenAdmin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenAdmin\", pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login/admin",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login",
                "admin"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Token de administrador para los casos 7, 8 y 15.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUsuario}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "P2 - Login cadete (guarda tokenVencido)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenVencido\", pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login/cadete",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login",
                "cadete"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Este token deja de valer cuando el caso 01 vuelve a iniciar sesión con el mismo usuario (una sola sesión por cadete). Se usa en el caso 06.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{cadeteUsuario}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{cadetePassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. POST /api/auth/login/cadete",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 - Login correcto -> 200",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"devuelve token Bearer de tipo CADETE\", function () {",
                  "  var r = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(r.token).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.expect(r.tokenType).to.eql(\"Bearer\");",
                  "  pm.expect(r.tipo).to.eql(\"CADETE\");",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"informa cuándo vence el token (expiresAt)\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().expiresAt).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty; });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenCadete\", pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login/cadete",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login",
                "cadete"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Usuario (DNI) y contraseña correctos. Devuelve el token y guarda tokenCadete.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{cadeteUsuario}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{cadetePassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02 - Contraseña incorrecta -> 401 CREDENCIALES_INVALIDAS",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 401\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(401); });",
                  "pm.test(\"codigo = CREDENCIALES_INVALIDAS\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().codigo).to.eql(\"CREDENCIALES_INVALIDAS\"); });",
                  "console.log(pm.info.requestName + \" -> \" + pm.response.code + \" \" + pm.response.json().codigo + \": \" + pm.response.json().message);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login/cadete",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login",
                "cadete"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mensaje esperado: \"Usuario o contraseña incorrectos.\"",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{cadeteUsuario}}\",\n  \"password\": \"clave-incorrecta\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03 - Letras donde va un número (versionApp) -> 400 VALIDACION",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 400\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(400); });",
                  "pm.test(\"codigo = VALIDACION\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().codigo).to.eql(\"VALIDACION\"); });",
                  "console.log(pm.info.requestName + \" -> \" + pm.response.code + \" \" + pm.response.json().codigo + \": \" + pm.response.json().message);",
                  "pm.test(\"señala el campo versionApp\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().fieldErrors).to.have.property(\"versionApp\"); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login/cadete",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login",
                "cadete"
              ]
            },
            "description": "versionApp es numérico. Mensaje esperado: \"El dato «versionApp» no tiene el formato correcto.\"",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{cadeteUsuario}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{cadetePassword}}\",\n  \"versionApp\": \"abc\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. GET /api/cadetes/me",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "04 - Token válido -> 200",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"devuelve los datos del cadete que inició sesión\", function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().dni).to.eql(pm.variables.get(\"cadeteUsuario\"));",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"no expone la contraseña\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.not.have.any.keys(\"password\", \"contrasenia\", \"clave\"); });",
                  "pm.test(\"incluye nombre y apellido\", function () { var c = pm.response.json(); pm.expect(c.nombre).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty; pm.expect(c.apellido).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty; });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"cadeteId\", pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenCadete}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/cadetes/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "cadetes",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Devuelve el perfil del cadete. Guarda cadeteId para los casos 07 y 09."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "05 - Token mal formado -> 401 NO_AUTENTICADO",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 401\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(401); });",
                  "pm.test(\"codigo = NO_AUTENTICADO\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().codigo).to.eql(\"NO_AUTENTICADO\"); });",
                  "console.log(pm.info.requestName + \" -> \" + pm.response.code + \" \" + pm.response.json().codigo + \": \" + pm.response.json().message);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer esto.no.esuntoken"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/cadetes/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "cadetes",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mensaje esperado: \"Tu sesión venció o no iniciaste sesión.\""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "06 - Token vencido (sesión anterior) -> 401 NO_AUTENTICADO",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 401\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(401); });",
                  "pm.test(\"codigo = NO_AUTENTICADO\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().codigo).to.eql(\"NO_AUTENTICADO\"); });",
                  "console.log(pm.info.requestName + \" -> \" + pm.response.code + \" \" + pm.response.json().codigo + \": \" + pm.response.json().message);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenVencido}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/cadetes/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "cadetes",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Usa el token del paso P2, que dejó de valer cuando el caso 01 inició sesión de nuevo. Mensaje esperado: \"Tu sesión venció o no iniciaste sesión.\""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. GET /api/admin/cadetes/{id}",
      "item": [
